Carafe bench: BAR.SYNC with register RZ as the barrier. NAK encodes "bar.sync 0" with register A = RZ
(sm50.rs), which reads as zero, the same barrier as the immediate 0 Eden accepts. Eden threw
"Non-immediate input A" and DXVK's HUD frame-time compute shader was not built.
GPL-3.0-or-later, as the file it changes.
